      "html": "<a class=\"ds-post\" href=\"/writing\"><h3 class=\"ds-post-title\">Everything, in writing.</h3><p class=\"ds-post-excerpt\">Notes on work, books, life, and the things still taking shape.</p><p class=\"ds-post-date\">Oct 22, 2026</p></a>",
